# Nothing in data/ is tracked — recordings, transcripts, reports, probe dumps.
# All of it is either raw capture from a live call or derived from it, and a
# recording of somebody's business line is not repo content. Reports that need
# to be kept get promoted deliberately, by a human, with the consent question
# already answered.
data/
temp/

# Harness-created agent worktrees (isolation) — never tracked or linted.
.claude/worktrees/
